# Who must approve changes. GitHub requests these reviewers automatically,
# and with branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners") a PR cannot
# merge without them. Later lines win over earlier ones.
#
# TODO: replace the placeholder team and user names with real GitHub handles.

# Default: the skills platform team reviews everything.
